        "identity": {
          "graphId": "declaration-template"
        },
        "title": "5. Decide what you share",
        "body": "Ports are optional named entry points that other graphs can use. Leave them out until you need one.\n\nBridges bring in the node classes you build with (imports, down the left of this graph) and offer yours to others (exports, top right). Authority says who may create, change or delete: people, agents, tools. Anything not granted is not allowed.",
        "presentation": {
